# state: any
# The Simpsons Hit & Run (56550015), lane.nfsdefault1011 step 3 (#433): free roam, blind.
# Copied from lane.frametrace's simpsons-frametrace.route (docs/lanes/frametrace/), proven to reach free
# roam on the Nova (golden bcc71e970cff; 1-1791245535-lane.frametrace-680559, NOTES.md section 8): "every
# route frame from `mark gameplay` to the end has Homer on foot in the world with the Marge portrait and
# the minimap, no dialog." Written from pathfind's held confirmation session (docs/lanes/pathfind/runs/
# screen-simpsons-hit-run/hold.log): logos (A x3, A), intro cinematic (START), title "PRESS START"
# (START), sky cutscene (START), main menu with NEW GAME the only item (A), five character cutscenes
# (START / A alternately), loading, tutorial boxes (A = Continue), free control at 152 s.
# Every screen on that path yields to START or A, so the entry is rounds of START then A: a press that
# lands early on a transition is repeated by the next round. In free control START pauses and the A after
# it takes the pause menu's first item (continue), so a round that lands in play costs one pause.
# Play: walk (LY min) with turns, A (jump; also Continue on a tutorial box).
# The play loop backs up before every forward-and-turn lap (lane.nfsdefault1011, 2026-10-11): the
# pre-mark approach walks blind into a concave corner of the house at this save's spawn point, and a
# turn alone does not clear it (confirmed in this lane's own OFF1/ON1 runs and, re-checked with
# hitch_report.py, in this route's original proving run 1-1791245535-lane.frametrace-680559 too --
# "reached free roam" was true, "stayed moving" was not, in all three). Reversing first before
# resuming forward motion is self-correcting against a re-wedge later in the window, not just the
# first one.
wait 10
repeat 30 {
    press START
    wait 2.5
    press A
    wait 2.5
    shot entry
}
repeat 3 {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    axis LY mid
    press A
    wait 2
}
shot gameplay
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 0.5
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    axis LX min
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    axis LY mid
    press A
    wait 1
    shot play
}
